# Anchored to the repository root. Unanchored, `data/` matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, which silently excluded the Android app's Room layer
# and then its tests - both written, neither committed, and invisible until a
# real compiler asked for them. firstmate's private records live at the top
# level of the home, so the root anchor is what was meant all along.
